    "notes": "The named PMTiles cathedral matches Wikidata Q744420. The mapped west towers establish the southwest-facing Santa María entrance, and the Sarmental steps face the south plaza. The model uses the mapped cathedral and ordinary exterior photographs. Vertical profiles, tracery, sculptures and small masonry details are visual approximations. The cloister court remains open. The closed portals represent the exterior only, and surrounding plazas, the fountain and adjacent buildings remain in the host map. Physical-device timings are unmeasured."
  },
